+**YAML route snippet (Orders)**
+
+```yaml
+- id: orders
+  uri: ${ORDERS_BASE_URL:http://orders-service:8085}
+  predicates:
+    - Path=/api/orders/**
+  filters:
+    - StripPrefix=1
+    - RewritePath=/api/orders/(?<p>.*),/orders/${p}
+    - CircuitBreaker=name=ordersCB,fallbackUri=forward:/fallback
+```
